          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設用紅色常亮停住。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text.7fe82cb2e12c": {
      "comment": "NativeSpeechTranscriptionService — 请重试或检查语音权限",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请重试或检查语音权限"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try again or check speech permissions"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再試行するか、音声権限を確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請重試或檢查語音權限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text.8020e151a950": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — Hook 的 auto-approve 立即切换到你选的档位。持久化到 UserDefaults，agent 重启仍生效",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hook 的 auto-approve 立即切换到你选的档位。持久化到 UserDefaults，agent 重启仍生效"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hook auto-approval immediately follows the selected position. Saved in UserDefaults and retained after Agent restarts"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hook の auto-approve を選択した設定にすぐに切り替えます。UserDefaults に永続化され、agent の再起動後も有効です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hook 的 auto-approve 立即切換到你選的檔位。持久化到 UserDefaults，agent 重啟仍生效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text.803253b86bf3": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — 8 颗 WS2812B，颜色由固件 update_claude_ws2812() 决定，1:1 还原在画布上",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8 颗 WS2812B，颜色由固件 update_claude_ws2812() 决定，1:1 还原在画布上"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eight WS2812B LEDs Follow Firmware update_claude_ws2812(), Mirrored on the Canvas"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8個のWS2812Bの色はファームウェアのupdate_claude_ws2812()によって決まり、1:1でキャンバスに再現されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8 顆 WS2812B，顏色由韌體 update_claude_ws2812() 決定，1:1 還原在畫布上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text.80575ae92e8a": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — 按住键盘录音键不松手开始录音，松手后直接将 ASR 结果写入，响应更快。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住键盘录音键不松手开始录音，松手后直接将 ASR 结果写入，响应更快。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold the keyboard's recording key to record. Release to insert the transcription directly for a faster response."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "キーボードの録音キーを長押しして録音します。離すと文字起こしを直接挿入し、応答を速くします。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住鍵盤錄音鍵不鬆手開始錄音，鬆手後直接將 ASR 結果寫入，響應更快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
