            "value": "首次连接，可以先打开「权限诊断」过一遍权限项；任何 Hook 不生效的问题大多在权限里。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On first connection, review Permission Diagnostics. Missing permissions cause many hook issues."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
