    "text.b686730dcdf2": {
      "comment": "1: removed subcommand count; 2: user configuration file path (preserve exactly). Plural selection uses argument 1 (Int). Translate the full sentence; positional placeholders may reorder arguments.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%#@count@"
          },
          "substitutions": {
            "count": {
              "argNum": 1,
              "formatSpecifier": "lld",
              "variations": {
                "plural": {
                  "other": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "已从用户级 Cursor Hooks 中移除 AhaKey 相关条目（共 %lld 条子命令）。\n\n文件：%@\n\n若某仓库仍有**项目级** `.cursor/hooks.json` 且其中含有本工具，其优先级可能更高，需在该项目内同步删除或合并。"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%#@count@"
          },
          "substitutions": {
            "count": {
              "argNum": 1,
              "formatSpecifier": "lld",
              "variations": {
                "plural": {
                  "one": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "Removed AhaKey entries from user-level Cursor Hooks (%1$lld subcommand).\n\nFile: %2$@\n\nA project’s .cursor/hooks.json may take precedence; remove or merge its entries separately."
                    }
                  },
                  "other": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "Removed AhaKey entries from user-level Cursor Hooks (%1$lld subcommands).\n\nFile: %2$@\n\nA project’s .cursor/hooks.json may take precedence; remove or merge its entries separately."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%#@count@"
          },
          "substitutions": {
            "count": {
              "argNum": 1,
              "formatSpecifier": "lld",
              "variations": {
                "plural": {
                  "other": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "ユーザーレベルのCursor HooksからAhaKey関連の項目（合計%lld個のコマンド）が削除されました。\n\nファイル：%@\n\nもしあるリポジトリにまだ**プロジェクトレベル**の `.cursor/hooks.json` があり、その中にこのツールが含まれている場合、その優先度は高くなる可能性があります。そのプロジェクト内で同期的に削除またはマージする必要があります。"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%#@count@"
          },
          "substitutions": {
            "count": {
              "argNum": 1,
              "formatSpecifier": "lld",
              "variations": {
                "plural": {
                  "other": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "已從使用者級 Cursor Hooks 中移除 AhaKey 相關條目（共 %lld 條子命令）。\n\n檔案：%@\n\n若某倉庫仍有**專案級** `.cursor/hooks.json` 且其中含有本工具，其優先順序可能更高，需在該專案內同步刪除或合併。"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
